  "method": "For all 13 repeat-transacted player-season assets in the 44-trade research dataset, scan every Sleeper week from first trade through next trade inclusive. Retrieve up to 100 raw transactions per week, check successful response and <100 returned, and inspect completed transactions of any type matching that player name. Verify stable Sleeper player ID at both completed trade receipts, exact transaction IDs and chronological timestamps. Intervening add/drop/waiver event is defined as a completed nontrade transaction between those timestamps. Do not claim all provider history is exhaustive or use no intervening event as affirmative proof of continuous ownership.",
