    "2022 Sleeper league ID 857125408712310784 verified from connected historical league chain"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The 2022 initial exploratory scan in trade-targeted-add-drop-audit-2022-2023-v1.json used an invalid 2022 league ID; ignore its 2022 rows. Corrected scans live in trade-targeted-add-drop-audit-2022-2024-corrected-v1.json.",
    "The 2023 historical team slot 2 requires commissioner-level Evans ownership correction; no manager attribution should be drawn from raw user-name roster labels alone.",
    "Provider transaction absence is not proof of an impossible waiver, hidden transaction, or precise lock-time rights.",
    "Stable player ID and chronological transaction receipts do not independently document every intervening weekly roster state.",
    "Does not model actual counterfactual replacement, playoff opportunity, keeper cost or FAAB."
